{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010062","bookName":"El amor que no volvió en primavera","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010062/42000010062.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1416875,"followCount":23757,"introduction":"Mariana se sacrificó para salvar a su esposo Javier y, tras un parto prematuro, perdió la capacidad de concebir. Siete años después descubrió que su hijo Luis era en realidad de Javier y su hermana Silvia, y que su propia hija fue abandonada. Supo además que él se casó con ella por Silvia. Al conocer la verdad, Mariana no lloró, sino que recolectó pruebas en secreto, se alió con el Instituto de Ciencias y, paso a paso, derrumbó el Grupo López.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[297],"typeTwoNames":["Amor Amargo"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":297,"name":"Amor Amargo","replaceName":"amor-amargo"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Amor-Amargo","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-amor-que-no-volvió-en-primavera","bookNameLower":"el-amor-que-no-volvió-en-primavera","shelfTime":"2026-04-29 18:51:22","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-29 18:51:22","performerList":[{"performerId":"21550","performerName":"Tianjing Zhang","performerFormatName":"Tianjing-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x5/21550/21550.jpg?time=1789888442187","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"23969","performerName":"Wei Han","performerFormatName":"Wei-Han","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x6/23969/23969.jpg?time=1786506496071","videoCount":4}],"performerIdList":[21550,23969]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700688327","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/72/2x6/26x0/260x0/26001000024/700688327_1/700688327.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795226400&Signature=fbfPvZgyvEnhaLDibS0BmN8ZUMtJYrgylMyevcyJ2C4nPmclnCnuj-0porMHBl0TD8UE~IyLxvXvL36~BVXGqMy-x-z5UziG2NqCTeiYJM4d1ecZijdRPsBE2RCR1o1ZoF6pvboXxtk4~aoHvTXt